OL,3,ANHS to suspend staff suspected of
OL,4,Asnooping on patient records
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS staff in England suspected of
OL,7,Flooking at patient records without a
OL,8,Fvalid reason will be immediately
OL,9,Fsuspended as part of a "zero-tolerance
OL,10,Fcrackdown" on snooping.
OL,12,FThose under suspicion will also be
OL,13,Flocked out of NHS computer systems,
OL,14,Fpreventing any further viewing of
OL,15,Fconfidential records, including from
OL,16,Fhome.
OL,18,FNHS England chief executive Sir Jim
OL,19,FMackey has written to every trust,
OL,20,Fordering the measures to be introduced
OL,21,Fimmediately to strengthen protection
OL,22,Fagainst data breaches.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
